Take a listen to this.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.500
David Démarche from China here.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.550
I'm thinking the most likely scenario on election
night is that Trump will declare victory because

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.720
most Republicans will vote in person.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.610
And most of their votes will have been carried
