00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:37.800
By that point in thinking, Democrats will
have their votes counted in basis not weeks

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.050
after.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:44.059
And Trump would call fraud potentially leading
to some violence.

00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:48.760
How how can you even prepare for something
like that?

