mostly Biden people.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.030
Now, the the exact proportions will determine
whether this happens.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:16.150
But it is a completely plausible scenario
that Trump seems to eke out some victory on

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:21.900
election night, claims victory, and then as
absentee ballots continue to be counted.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.250
I don't think it will take weeks, but it certainly
could take five days.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:29.900
The lead for Trump shrinks, shrinks, shrinks,
until ultimately Joe Biden takes an electoral

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.230
lead.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:39.370
And you are completely correct, Tomas, that
that is a scenario ripe for real world violence.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:43.090
And so the question about how to be prepared
for it is twofold.

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:50.130
First of all, police departments and national
law enforcement, federal law enforcement need

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:57.960
to take seriously the possibility of not protests
of overwhelmingly unarmed individuals, but

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:03.470
angry weaponized Trump ists with firearms
taking to the streets.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.600
That's a law enforcement question.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:11.450
The political question is we know because
Trump has said that they're going to do this

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:15.380
and people around him have said they've got
an army of lawyers ready to go.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.870
We know that if this scenario happens, if
Trump seems to be ahead on election night

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:24.620
with a lot of absentee ballots still to be
counted immediately, they are going to file

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.010
