from being counted.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:32.370
They are going to try to say they've got to
be in by it by midnight Election Day or they've

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.490
got to be in by the next day.

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:36.090
But you can't just keep counting absentee
ballots.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:38.100
Whether they will get away with it, I don't
know.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:45.500
But Democrats and Joe Biden's campaign need
to have a proactive plan for how they are

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.400
going to fight that in court.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:52.390
Now, unfortunately, when Trump brags he's
put in place, is it 200 something, 300 judges

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.900
at this point?

00:02:53.900 --> 00:03:01.280
It may be some of those judges who end up
deciding in some states, do the absentee ballots

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.330
continue to be counted or not?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.990
So it is a very serious scenario.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.540
And I don't know if Democrats are going to
be prepared if history is an indicator.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.530
Democrats may well not be prepared for that.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.340
And that's very, very scary.

